>In all honesty, I was completely unaware that Saudi Arabia still
>has slavery.  Could you tell more about this?

I don't know much myself. A friend of mine has had occaision to work in
Saudi Arabia, including within the royal palace. This friend informed me
that the royal family still openly owned slaves. I'm not sure how much of a
trade there is at present.

